routine nature.  Include unusual cleanup requirements.</NPR><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/></NTE>
<BRK/>
<TXT>The following cleanup requirements apply:  [_____].</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
]</SPT><TAI OPT="ARMY,NAVY"><SPT><TTL>REAL PROPERTY RECORD</TTL><BRK/>
