<BRK/>
<TXT>Near the completion of Project, but a minimum of 60 days prior to final acceptance of the work, complete[, update 
draft DD FORM 1354,] and submit an accounting of all installed property with <SUB>Interim DD FORM 1354</SUB>.  Include any 
